#: src/sharing-environment-variables-between-recipes.md:1
msgid "Sharing Environment Variables Between Recipes"
msgstr ""

#: src/sharing-environment-variables-between-recipes.md:3
msgid ""
"Each line of each recipe is executed by a fresh shell, so it is not possible "
"to share environment variables between recipes."
msgstr ""

